        decision: `Compare it with $\\log 2x^{3}$, which is what the slip produces: at $x = ${CUBE_CHECK[0].x}$ that comes to $${CUBE_CHECK[0].slip}$, not $${CUBE_CHECK[0].correct}$.`,
        earns: ["W1"],
