        working: `Build the missing one: $2 = \\frac{10}{5}$, so $\\log 2 = \\log 10 - \\log 5 = 1 - q$.`,
        decision: `To base $10$, $\\log 10 = 1$. That is what lets a logarithm you were not given be built from the ones you were.`,
